\ \/ / | | | __|
 >  <| |_| | |_ 
/_/\_\\__,_|\__| ${resetColour}"
printf "%s\n" "${yellow}${bold}
*x*tra *u*ser *t*emplates
Build and install packages for Void Linux, from unofficial abyss-packages template repo.
